  "L’un des deux suffit — Verdict recoupe les deux.":["Either one is enough — Verdict cross-checks them when both are entered.","Con uno basta — Verdict cruza ambos si se introducen los dos.","Ne basta uno — Verdict li confronta se vengono inseriti entrambi.","Einer der beiden Werte genügt — Verdict gleicht beide ab, wenn Sie beide eingeben.","Eén van beide volstaat — Verdict vergelijkt ze wanneer u beide invult.","Um dos dois basta — o Verdict cruza ambos quando são preenchidos."],
