  "Quatre formats : audit Premium complet, dossier comptable, dossier banque / associé, rapport exécutif d’une page.":["Four formats: full Premium audit, accountant pack, bank / partner pack, one-page executive report.","Cuatro formatos: auditoría Premium completa, dossier contable, dossier banco / socio e informe ejecutivo de una página.","Quattro formati: audit Premium completo, dossier commercialista, dossier banca / socio, report executive di una pagina.","Vier Formate: vollständiges Premium-Audit, Steuerberater-Dossier, Bank-/Partner-Dossier, einseitiger Executive Report.","Vier formaten: volledige Premium-audit, accountantsdossier, bank-/partnerdossier, executive rapport van één pagina.","Quatro formatos: auditoria Premium completa, dossier contabilista, dossier banco / sócio, relatório executivo de uma página."],
